{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262289-bringing-the-lost-into-changeling-the-dreaming","id":1262289,"title":"Bringing the Lost into Changeling the Dreaming!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-22T21:25:54-07:00","id":1262289,"title":"Bringing the Lost into Changeling the Dreaming!","content":"Here me out what if I include the lost into changeling games? So the basic idea is Fomorians and Tuatha start taking mortals to the deep Dreaming and leaving behind fetches, to bolster their numbers for the coming war. These mortals start becoming Fae. Some that escape and are mostly human retain their mortal bodies and are Autumn lost, like a mix of Dark Age Changelings and dreaming ones. Some escape but are too warped in body and or mind and need to take up hosts like the Sidhe, these are the Arcadian lost.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T13:15:26-07:00","id":1262398,"title":"","content":"Interesting, although I would be interested in how the mechanics of Lost and Dreaming interact. Would you be using Losts system for the Lost or would you adapt them to the Dreaming mechanics and only keep the very idea of the Lost?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-23T13:58:57-07:00","id":1262406,"title":"","content":"Dreaming Mechanics but lots of lost Flavor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T11:29:17-07:00","id":1262697,"title":"","content":"I don't like the idea of actual Tuatha and Fomorians existing (to me, they are only misinterpretations of the four courts of Fae), so I'd use a different source of mortals who come to the dreaming. Actually, in my current game there was a thallain ruled realm, where mortals and kithain were kept as slaves. The humans actually take on some fae characteristics, as the Lost would in your idea, however they probably won't turn entirely Lost in that setting.<br /> The thallain didn't bother setting up fetches, though... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-25T21:21:00-07:00","id":1262793,"title":"","content":"We did actually have a thread discussing this, although it was the reverse of Dreaming -&gt; Lost.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1160920-asking-help-in-translating-dreaming-concepts-to-lost\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1160920-asking-help-in-translating-dreaming-concepts-to-lost\"> Asking help in translating Dreaming concepts to Lost - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1160920-asking-help-in-translating-dreaming-concepts-to-lost\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1160920-asking-help-in-translating-dreaming-concepts-to-lost </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So, I finally bit the bullet and got the pdf of C20, and I must say: WHERE WERE YOU IN THE ORIGINAL CWOD!? WHERE!? To put it simply, I like it, whereas before, the first Dreaming book I read (and threw against the wall) was The Autumn People. However, I am primarily a Lost fan, so I'm more likely to translate things from Dreaming to Lost. Which is why I'm here, asking for more experienced help when fishing for suggestions. Off the top of my head: * Lost changelings and Kithain both exist and are often grudging allies. The Lost have an understandable suspicion of everything originally Arcadian, </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T10:10:11-07:00","id":1263610,"title":"","content":"Once both CtD and CtL are in Storyteller\u2019s Vault, I\u2019d like to see a Changeling Translation Guide. If you can translate between the Demon lines of World and Chronicles, then you should be able to translate between the two Changelings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T11:46:17-07:00","id":1263635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262289-bringing-the-lost-into-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1263610#post1263610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once both CtD and CtL are in Storyteller\u2019s Vault, I\u2019d like to see a Changeling Translation Guide. If you can translate between the Demon lines of World and Chronicles, then you should be able to translate between the two Changelings.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would imagine it would be muuuch easier and more practical for changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T18:41:27-07:00","id":1263718,"title":"","content":"I&quot;ve been thinking about this and it might just be easier to Go DA:FAe then Lost as timeline and drop Dreaming entirely since Banality sort of messes things up..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T20:58:00-07:00","id":1263736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262289-bringing-the-lost-into-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1263718#post1263718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I&amp;quot;ve been thinking about this and it might just be easier to Go DA:FAe then Lost as timeline and drop Dreaming entirely since Banality sort of messes things up..</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically that\u2019s what I\u2019m doing, I\u2019m saying they go back into throwback mode, like in the modern times the Tuatha and Fomorians (mostly mythologizing the old Dark Age Courts) are finding themselves quite infertile, so they need to make a new generation through changelings. But the Lost ideas are more for flavor since it concentrates on nabbing people<br /> To take to Arcadia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T21:42:01-07:00","id":1263739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1262289-bringing-the-lost-into-changeling-the-dreaming?p=1263736#post1263736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Technically that\u2019s what I\u2019m doing, I\u2019m saying they go back into throwback mode, like in the modern times the Tuatha and Fomorians (mostly mythologizing the old Dark Age Courts) are finding themselves quite infertile, so they need to make a new generation through changelings. But the Lost ideas are more for flavor since it concentrates on nabbing people<br /> To take to Arcadia.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What would you use mechanically? It seems banality would be an extremely poor fit here. I mean why would any Lost style changeling run from something that makes the more normal and less messable with by the OThers? IT also very much limits the sort of changelings as low banality dreamer types...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-30T23:21:17-07:00","id":1263750,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not a complete copy.<br /> <br /> But that is a good point. But I imagine since they become Fae they do not seek the oblivion of Banality. Maybe the Autumn Lost actually even die if they are lost to banality.<br /> <br /> And they may enjoy being Fae, but they hate being slaves and pets. Depends on the blokes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T09:07:07-08:00","id":1265840,"title":"","content":"Things to keep in mind when trying to cross over Dreaming and Lost:<br /> <br /> - The relationship between the Kithain and the Lost. Do they get along? Are they enemies? Can one help another? Is a combination of the two possible? Can one become the other?<br /> - How the Dreaming and the Hedge relate to one another. Are they the same thing? Do they have different regions?<br /> - Freeholds and Freeholds: how do the two interact? Can one be both at the same time?<br /> - NPF (Non-player Fairies). How do they interact? Are Goblins a type of Dark-Kin? How do the Thallain factor in?<br /> - Arcadia and Arcadia. One's a mystery, the other a place of horror. Are they the same place? How does Arcadia being there affect Dreaming?<br /> - The True Fae, the Fomorians and the Tuatha de Danaan. Are the True Fae from Lost the Fomorians from Dreaming? Are they the Tuatha de Danaan? Or maybe both?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T12:16:16-08:00","id":1265891,"title":"","content":"Lost are just a type of changeling. Only one Arcadia. No Hedge. And true Fae are Both Fomorians and Tuatha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}